# Stage I (Data Engineering & EDA) requires no environment variables or API keys.
# This file is a placeholder for later stages (e.g. an LLM key for the
# RAG/agent stages) and will be filled in when those stages are implemented.

# Stage IV (GenAI + RAG) - OPTIONAL. If neither is set, or this environment
# has no network access to reach the API, src/rag/generator.py falls back
# to a local, deterministic, evidence-only answer generator - the pipeline
# is fully testable either way. Never commit a real key to this file.
